    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 0.86
  m_Text: In this game you are a noble pharaoh fighting against demons. To survive
    this battle you must think tactically and come up with your own strategy. During
    each round, you will see the demon's actions in the red cells. The yellow cells
    will contain your actions. After the round ends, your bottom lane will face the
    demon's lane. If you put a shield in front of a demon's sword, then you will
    block the damage, and you can do the same against a demon. If you place a heart,
    you can restore one health to yourself; a demon cannot restore health. The demon
    can only attack, defend, or do nothing. Your main skill is the ability to exchange
    one of your cells for another, thereby attacking or blocking damage. You can
    change your action 3 times per turn
